  - m_Id: 8006398797754373
    m_Localized: "Her i\u015Fe uygun: h\u0131z, yol tutu\u015F ve z\u0131rh dengeli.
      \xC7izgini koru, f\u0131rsat olunca sava\u015F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006398797754374
    m_Localized: "A\u011F\u0131r ve sa\u011Flam, her iti\u015Fmeyi kazan\u0131r.
      Ge\xE7 durur: erken fren yap, sonra toslat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006398797754375
    m_Localized: "Asfaltta yava\u015F ama paletleri \xE7imde neredeyse yava\u015Flamaz.
